  "source_caveat": "The publicly retrieved BLS Producer Price Index monthly series measure net-output producer prices, not the invoices or freight charges paid by any particular customer. The illustrative annual arithmetic-mean PPI adjustment of published nominal Census employer industry revenues is only a price-adjusted revenue proxy, not an official BLS/Census real-output series, shipped tonnage, volume, business demand, billing-error or recoverable cash measure. Annual price index averages are unweighted across months and coverage may differ from Census industry revenues. NAICS 484 aggregate source was not available from the original API in the recorded probe; no aggregate PPI deflation is authorized. Data can be revised; exact 2017–2024 monthly values and missing/preliminary observations must be verified afresh. All 18 separate real-customer pilot evidence controls remain unmet."
